{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaXUvvBUVaJ6qCb5hfKL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I replaced the `sorry` in `take_append_drop`, and `lean Main.lean` now runs with no errors or warnings.\n\nThe proof works by induction on `n`, with `xs` allowed to vary at each step:\n\n```lean\n  induction n generalizing xs with\n  | zero => simp [myTake, myDrop]\n  | succ n ih =>\n    cases xs with\n    | nil => simp [myTake, myDrop]\n    | cons x xs => simp [myTake, myDrop, ih]\n```\n\n- **`n = 0`:** `myTake` gives `[]` and `myDrop` gives `xs`, so the two sides match.\n- **`n + 1` with an empty list:** both functions return `[]`, and `[] ++ []` is `[]`.\n- **`n + 1` with `x :: xs`:** after unfolding, the goal becomes `x :: (myTake n xs ++ myDrop n xs) = x :: xs`. The induction hypothesis then closes it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":458,"cache_read_input_tokens":7964,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":458},"output_tokens":324,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83e30f38-a459-478b-86f2-630d9611839a","uuid":"a6ff0dca-7c76-487d-8165-624beec20bab","timestamp":"2026-10-31T15:09:15.796Z","request_id":"req_011CgaXUvg3KSBAjaHjMN8x8"}
